msgid ""
"Has there been a significant business combination or disposal of a "
"significant subsidiary after the reporting period?"
msgstr "Apakah ada kombinasi bisnis signifikan atau pelepasan entitas anak signifikan setelah periode pelaporan?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_specific_procedure
#: model:general_audit_subsequent_event,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_specific_procedure.general_audit_subsequent_event_13_7ed5cef0
msgid ""
"Has there been an announcement of or the commencement of a significant "
"restructuring?"
msgstr "Apakah ada pengumuman atau dimulainya restrukturisasi signifikan?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_specific_procedure
#: model:general_audit_subsequent_event,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_specific_procedure.general_audit_subsequent_event_7_b1ebccc6
msgid "Has there been an announcement to discontinue an operation?"
msgstr "Apakah ada pengumuman penghentian suatu operasi?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_specific_procedure
#: model:general_audit_subsequent_event,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_specific_procedure.general_audit_subsequent_event_15_f8b89132
msgid "Has there been an issuance of debt instruments?"
msgstr "Apakah ada penerbitan instrumen utang?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_specific_procedure
#: model:general_audit_subsequent_event,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_specific_procedure.general_audit_subsequent_event_5_f77354d7
msgid ""
"Has there been discovery of fraud or error indicating that the financial "
"statements are incorrect?"
msgstr "Apakah ditemukan kecurangan atau kesalahan yang menunjukkan laporan keuangan tidak benar?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_specific_procedure
#: model:general_audit_subsequent_event,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_specific_procedure.general_audit_subsequent_event_12_928cd4cd
msgid ""
"Has there been significant damage to production facilities due to fire after"
" the reporting period?"
msgstr "Apakah terjadi kerusakan signifikan pada fasilitas produksi akibat kebakaran setelah periode pelaporan?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_specific_procedure
#: model:general_audit_subsequent_event,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_specific_procedure.general_audit_subsequent_event_11_006abfd8
msgid "Has there been significant expropriation of assets by the Government?"
msgstr "Apakah terjadi perampasan aset signifikan oleh Pemerintah?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_specific_procedure
#: model:general_audit_subsequent_event,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_specific_procedure.general_audit_subsequent_event_19_f5851ecb
msgid ""
"Has there been the commencement of significant legal proceedings arising "
"solely from events occurring after the reporting period?"
msgstr "Apakah dimulai proses hukum signifikan yang timbul hanya dari peristiwa setelah periode pelaporan?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_specific_procedure
#: model:general_audit_subsequent_event,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_specific_procedure.general_audit_subsequent_event_18_34a0222e
msgid ""
"Has there been the giving of commitments or the incurrence of significant "
"contingent liabilities, for example the issuance of significant guarantees?"
msgstr "Apakah ada pemberian komitmen atau timbul kewajiban kontinjensi signifikan, misalnya penerbitan garansi signifikan?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_specific_procedure
#: model:general_audit_subsequent_event,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_specific_procedure.general_audit_subsequent_event_10_481244da
msgid ""
"Has there been, or is there a plan for, the disposal of other significant "
"assets?"
msgstr "Apakah telah atau akan ada rencana pelepasan aset signifikan lainnya?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_specific_procedure
#: model:general_audit_subsequent_event,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_specific_procedure.general_audit_subsequent_event_8_4743bbc8
msgid "Has there been, or is there a plan to, purchase significant assets?"
msgstr "Apakah telah atau akan ada rencana pembelian aset signifikan?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_specific_procedure
#: model:general_audit_related_party_confirmation_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_specific_procedure.general_audit_related_party_confirmation_procedure_21_71a0b13b
msgid ""
"Have the known related party relationships and transactions been recorded "
"and disclosed in accordance with the applicable financial reporting "
"framework?"
msgstr "Apakah hubungan dan transaksi pihak berelasi yang diketahui telah dicatat dan diungkapkan sesuai kerangka pelaporan keuangan yang berlaku?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_specific_procedure
#: model:general_audit_subsequent_event,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_specific_procedure.general_audit_subsequent_event_17_ac8d1d28
msgid ""
"Have there been changes in tax rates or tax regulations enacted or announced"
" after the reporting period that have a significant effect on current and "
"deferred tax assets and liabilities?"
msgstr "Apakah ada perubahan tarif atau regulasi pajak yang diberlakukan atau diumumkan setelah periode pelaporan yang berdampak signifikan pada aset dan liabilitas pajak kini dan tangguhan?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_specific_procedure
#: model:general_audit_subsequent_event,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_specific_procedure.general_audit_subsequent_event_20_84ac025d
msgid ""
"Have there been events that are relevant to the measurement of estimates or "
"provisions recognized in the financial statements?"
msgstr "Apakah ada peristiwa yang relevan dengan pengukuran estimasi atau provisi yang diakui dalam laporan keuangan?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_specific_procedure
#: model:general_audit_subsequent_event,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_specific_procedure.general_audit_subsequent_event_21_74dc2abb
msgid ""
"Have there been events that are relevant to the recoverability of assets?"
msgstr "Apakah ada peristiwa yang relevan dengan keterpulihan aset?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_specific_procedure
#: model:general_audit_subsequent_event,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_specific_procedure.general_audit_subsequent_event_16_968e3900
msgid ""
"Have there been significant abnormal changes after the reporting period in "
"asset prices or foreign exchange rates?"
msgstr "Apakah terjadi perubahan abnormal signifikan setelah periode pelaporan pada harga aset atau kurs valas?"

