#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_specific_procedure
#: model:general_audit_subsequent_event,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_specific_procedure.general_audit_subsequent_event_1_979729d8
msgid ""
"Is there a court case settlement after the reporting period that determines "
"the entity had a present obligation at the end of the reporting period?"
msgstr "Apakah ada penyelesaian perkara hukum setelah periode pelaporan yang menetapkan entitas memiliki kewajiban kini pada akhir periode pelaporan?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_specific_procedure
#: model:general_audit_subsequent_event,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_specific_procedure.general_audit_subsequent_event_3_ab8767a5
msgid ""
"Is there a determination after the reporting period of the acquisition cost "
"of assets purchased or the proceeds from assets sold before the end of the "
"reporting period?"
msgstr "Apakah ada penetapan setelah periode pelaporan atas biaya perolehan aset yang dibeli atau hasil aset yang dijual sebelum akhir periode pelaporan?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_specific_procedure
#: model:general_audit_subsequent_event,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_specific_procedure.general_audit_subsequent_event_9_6efa2db7
msgid ""
"Is there classification of assets as assets held for sale in accordance with"
" PSAK 58?"
msgstr "Apakah ada klasifikasi aset sebagai aset dimiliki untuk dijual sesuai PSAK 58?"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_specific_procedure
#: model:general_audit_subsequent_event,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_specific_procedure.general_audit_subsequent_event_2_d70e7963
msgid ""
"Is there information indicating impairment of asset values at the end of the"
" reporting period or the need to adjust amounts previously recognized as "
"impairment losses? Examples: (i) a customer bankruptcy occurring after the "
"reporting period typically confirms a loss on trade receivables, and (ii) "
"inventory sales after the reporting period may provide evidence of net "
"realizable value."
msgstr ""
"Apakah ada informasi yang menunjukkan penurunan nilai aset pada akhir periode pelaporan atau kebutuhan menyesuaikan jumlah yang sebelumnya diakui sebagai rugi penurunan nilai? Contoh: (i) kebangkrutan pelanggan setelah periode pelaporan biasanya mengonfirmasi kerugian piutang usaha, (ii) penjualan persediaan setelah periode pelaporan dapat memberi bukti nilai realisasi bersih."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_specific_procedure
#: model:general_audit_subsequent_event,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_specific_procedure.general_audit_subsequent_event_4_2823e739
msgid ""
"Is there payment of profit-sharing or bonuses after the reporting period "
"where the entity has a present legal or constructive obligation at the end "
"of the reporting period to make the payment as a result of events after that"
" date (SAK 57)?"
msgstr ""
"Apakah ada pembayaran bagi hasil atau bonus setelah periode pelaporan di mana entitas memiliki kewajiban hukum atau konstruktif pada akhir periode pelaporan untuk melakukan pembayaran akibat peristiwa setelah tanggal tersebut (SAK 57)?"

